# Web3Forms access key for the Contact form (https://web3forms.com: enter your email, they send you a key).
# Copy this file to .env and paste the key after the = sign. Without a key the form falls back to opening
# your email app (mailto:), so the site never breaks.
# Restart the dev server / rebuild after changing it: Vite reads .env at build time.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
